 "ability_desc": "Glow pocket: every 2 s, while its owner is within 10 blocks and either in water or in the dark (light 7 or less), it squirts a puff of glowing fluid from its pockets: monsters within 12 blocks of its owner glow (it marks them through walls and murky water), so do fish while you are in water, and an owner under water gets Night Vision. Then it rests 20 s. It squirts from its fishbowl on land too. Bond (0 -> 5): rests 20 -> 10 s, marks out to 12 -> 22 blocks, glow and Night Vision last 5 -> 10 s.",
